# Configuration files (keep examples but ignore actual configs).
# Anchored to repo root (not "config.json"/"container.json" bare, which
# would also match containers/container.json -- that one's a portable,
# non-machine-specific default and should stay tracked).
/config.json
/container.json
# setup.sh-generated copy of container.json or container_apptainer.json --
# not meant to be hand-maintained or committed.
containers/container_active.json
